{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"は----い＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もこんばんわぁ---ん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ-です //"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアー初日 北海道 札幌、\nお疲れ様でしたー(・ω・)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋にて。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/08/21/4441732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもおろしている髪の毛を\n今回は 編み込みポニーで\nまとめてみました \\(´▽`)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろにいるのは\nあにあに、らりん、まいまい、ちはる^^"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/08/21/4441732/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"札幌まで来てくださった皆さん、\n本当にありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり ライブは最高だし\n皆と一緒に 歌って踊って跳ねて\n汗も いっぱいかけたね (。・ω・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆さんも自分自身も\nもっと わいてしまう様なliveに\nして行きます★！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直、反省点も\nいっぱいあります ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来て頂いた人 １人残らず\n楽しんでもらって帰れたか？\nって聞かれると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直 自信ありません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと自分たちなら\n上を目指せるんちゃうか って\n思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります☆★☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高3同士、まひろ と まりかだぉ(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/08/21/4441732/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晩御飯は 最高においちかったよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょ-しのって勢いで食べ過ぎて\nお腹ぱんぱんになったよ(・▽・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海鮮類"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/08/21/4441732/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろ あみ 生駒 あすか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ笑ったし楽しかった☆\nこれはすべらんやろう。思う話したら\n爆笑してくれた 笑。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、あの話は blogやテレビでは\nNGやなっ あはん♪しーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではではっ おやすみなさい♪"}],"source":"archive"}